station","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p074","quote":"二十七年五月戊申，大朝於東宮，傳國，立王子何以爲王。王廟見禮畢，出臨朝。大夫悉爲臣，肥義爲相國，并傅王。是爲惠文王。惠文王，惠后吳娃子也。武靈王自號爲主父。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji043-058:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p074","start":49,"end":50,"surface":"傅","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0042","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"明示授予、自號及廢太子與敘事用稱分開；分趙而王章的未決計畫不是授予。死亡與傳國不推所有官爵終點，回敘太子不補曆日。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-157","person_id":"cbr-p002386","surfaces":["義","肥義"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p060","quote":"武靈王元年，陽文君趙豹相。梁襄王與太子嗣，韓宣王與太子倉來朝信宮。武靈王少，未能聽政，博聞師三人，左右司過三人。及聽政，先問先王貴臣肥義，加其秩；國三老年八十，月致其禮。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p067","quote":"十九年春正月，大朝信宮。召肥義與議天下，五日而畢。王北略中山之地，至於房子，遂之代，北至無窮，西至河，登黃華之上。召樓緩謀曰：「我先王因世之變，以長南藩之地，屬阻漳、滏之險，立長城，又取藺、郭狼，敗林人於荏，而功未遂。今中山在我腹心，北有燕，東有胡，西有林胡、樓煩、秦、韓之邊，而無彊兵之救，是亡社稷，柰何？夫有髙世之名，必有遺俗之累。吾欲胡服。」樓緩曰：「善。」群臣皆不欲。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p068","quote":"於是肥義侍，王曰：「簡、襄主之烈，計胡、翟之利。爲人臣者，寵有孝弟長幼順明之節，通有補民益主之業，此兩者臣之分也。今吾欲繼襄主之跡，開於胡、翟之鄕，而卒世不見也。爲敵弱，用力少而功多，可以毋盡百姓之勞，而序往古之勳。夫有髙世之功者，負遺俗之累；有獨智之慮者，任驁民之怨。今吾將胡服騎射以教百姓，而世必議寡人，柰何？」肥義曰：「臣聞疑事無功，疑行無名。王旣定負遺俗之慮，殆無顧天下之議矣。夫論至德者不和於俗，成大功者不謀於衆。昔者舜舞有苗，禹袒裸國，非以養欲而樂志也，務以論德而約功也。愚者闇成事，智者睹未形，則王何疑焉。」王曰：「吾不疑胡服也，吾恐天下笑我也。狂夫之樂，智者哀焉；愚者所笑，賢者察焉。世有順我者，胡服之功未可知也。雖驅世以笑我，胡地中山吾必有之。」於是遂胡服矣。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p074","quote":"二十七年五月戊申，大朝於東宮，傳國，立王子何以爲王。王廟見禮畢，出臨朝。大夫悉爲臣，肥義爲相國，并傅王。是爲惠文王。惠文王，惠后吳娃子也。武靈王自號爲主父。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p078","quote":"李兌謂肥義曰：「公子章彊壯而志驕，黨衆而欲大，殆有私乎？田不禮之爲人也，忍殺而驕。二人相得，必有謀陰賊起，一出身徼幸。夫小人有欲，輕慮淺謀，徒見其利而不顧其害，同類相推，倶入禍門。以吾觀之，必不久矣。子任重而勢大，亂之所始，禍之所集也，子必先患。仁者愛萬物而智者備禍於未形，不仁不智，何以爲國？子奚不稱疾毋出，傳政於公子成？毋爲怨府，毋爲禍梯。」肥義曰：「不可，昔者主父以王屬義也，曰：『毋變而度，毋異而慮，堅守一心，以歿而世。』義再拜受命而籍之。今畏不禮之難而忘吾籍，變孰大焉。進受嚴命，退而不全，負孰甚焉。變負之臣，不容於刑。諺曰『死者復生，生者不愧』。吾言已在前矣，吾欲全吾言，安得全吾身！且夫貞臣也難至而節見，忠臣也累至而行明。子則有賜而忠我矣，雖然，吾有語在前者也，終不敢失。」李兌曰：「諾，子勉之矣！吾見子已今年耳。」涕泣而出。李兌數見公子成，以備田不禮之事。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p079","quote":"異日肥義謂信期曰：「公子與田不禮甚可憂也。其於義也聲善而實惡，此爲人也不子不臣。吾聞之也，姦臣在朝，國之殘也；讒臣在中，主之蠹也。此人貪而欲大，内得主而外爲暴。矯令爲慢，以擅一旦之命，不難爲也，禍且逮國。今吾憂之，夜而忘寐，饑而忘食。盜賊出入不可不備。自今以來，若有召王者必見吾面，我將先以身當之，無故而王乃入。」信期曰：「善哉，吾得聞此也！」"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p081","quote":"主父及王游沙丘，異宮，公子章卽以其徒與田不禮作亂，詐以主父令召王。肥義先入，殺之。髙信卽與王戰。公子成與李兌自國至，乃起四邑之兵入距難，殺公子章及田不禮，滅其黨賊而定王室。公子成爲相，號安平君，李兌爲司寇。公子章之敗，往走主父，主主開之，成、兌因圍主父宮。公子章死，公子成、李兌謀曰：「以章故圍主父，卽解兵，吾屬夷矣。」乃遂圍主父。令宮中人「後出者夷」，宮中人悉出。主父欲出不得，又不得食，探爵鷇而食之，三月餘而餓死沙丘宮。主父定死，乃發喪赴諸侯。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為與連續事件；太戊午／大戊午暫接但字形待底本核查。娃嬴／孟姚／惠后按本段明示暫接，不與先前夢辭孟姚按同名合併；王紲與較早公子紲分候選。君王職稱按各國上下文辨別，不全域匹配。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p060","text":"武靈王元年，陽文君趙豹相。梁襄王與太子嗣，韓宣王與太子倉來朝信宮。武靈王少，未能聽政，博聞師三人，左右司過三人。及聽政，先問先王貴臣肥義，加其秩；國三老年八十，月致其禮。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"武靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0006","start":6,"end":11,"surface":"陽文君趙豹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002381","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"梁襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002382","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0017","start":17,"end":20,"surface":"太子嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002383","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"韓宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002384","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"太子倉","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002385","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"武靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0043","start":43,"end":48,"surface":"博聞師三人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、夢中女子或待核官稱／親稱保留；不從同名、國號與未名先王補個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0049","start":49,"end":55,"surface":"左右司過三人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、夢中女子或待核官稱／親稱保留；不從同名、國號與未名先王補個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m060-0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"三老","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、夢中女子或待核官稱／親稱保留；不從同名、國號與未名先王補個人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p067","text":"十九年春正月，大朝信宮。召肥義與議天下，五日而畢。王北略中山之地，至於房子，遂之代，北至無窮，西至河，登黃華之上。召樓緩謀曰：「我先王因世之變，以長南藩之地，屬阻漳、滏之險，立長城，又取藺、郭狼，敗林人於荏，而功未遂。今中山在我腹心，北有燕，東有胡，西有林胡、樓煩、秦、韓之邊，而無彊兵之救，是亡社稷，柰何？夫有髙世之名，必有遺俗之累。吾欲胡服。」樓緩曰：「善。」群臣皆不欲。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002402","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"樓緩","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002402","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m067-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"群臣","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、夢中女子或待核官稱／親稱保留；不從同名、國號與未名先王補個人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p068","text":"於是肥義侍，王曰：「簡、襄主之烈，計胡、翟之利。爲人臣者，寵有孝弟長幼順明之節，通有補民益主之業，此兩者臣之分也。今吾欲繼襄主之跡，開於胡、翟之鄕，而卒世不見也。爲敵弱，用力少而功多，可以毋盡百姓之勞，而序往古之勳。夫有髙世之功者，負遺俗之累；有獨智之慮者，任驁民之怨。今吾將胡服騎射以教百姓，而世必議寡人，柰何？」肥義曰：「臣聞疑事無功，疑行無名。王旣定負遺俗之慮，殆無顧天下之議矣。夫論至德者不和於俗，成大功者不謀於衆。昔者舜舞有苗，禹袒裸國，非以養欲而樂志也，務以論德而約功也。愚者闇成事，智者睹未形，則王何疑焉。」王曰：「吾不疑胡服也，吾恐天下笑我也。狂夫之樂，智者哀焉；愚者所笑，賢者察焉。世有順我者，胡服之功未可知也。雖驅世以笑我，胡地中山吾必有之。」於是遂胡服矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"簡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002292","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"襄","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002306","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"襄主","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002306","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0158","start":158,"end":160,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0175","start":175,"end":176,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0214","start":214,"end":215,"surface":"舜","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002302","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0219","start":219,"end":220,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002403","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0255","start":255,"end":256,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m068-0261","start":261,"end":262,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p074","text":"二十七年五月戊申，大朝於東宮，傳國，立王子何以爲王。王廟見禮畢，出臨朝。大夫悉爲臣，肥義爲相國，并傅王。是爲惠文王。惠文王，惠后吳娃子也。武靈王自號爲主父。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0019","start":19,"end":22,"surface":"王子何","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"王廟見","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"大夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0050","start":50,"end":51,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"惠文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0058","start":58,"end":61,"surface":"惠文王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0062","start":62,"end":66,"surface":"惠后吳娃","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002396","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"武靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m074-0075","start":75,"end":77,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p078","text":"李兌謂肥義曰：「公子章彊壯而志驕，黨衆而欲大，殆有私乎？田不禮之爲人也，忍殺而驕。二人相得，必有謀陰賊起，一出身徼幸。夫小人有欲，輕慮淺謀，徒見其利而不顧其害，同類相推，倶入禍門。以吾觀之，必不久矣。子任重而勢大，亂之所始，禍之所集也，子必先患。仁者愛萬物而智者備禍於未形，不仁不智，何以爲國？子奚不稱疾毋出，傳政於公子成？毋爲怨府，毋爲禍梯。」肥義曰：「不可，昔者主父以王屬義也，曰：『毋變而度，毋異而慮，堅守一心，以歿而世。』義再拜受命而籍之。今畏不禮之難而忘吾籍，變孰大焉。進受嚴命，退而不全，負孰甚焉。變負之臣，不容於刑。諺曰『死者復生，生者不愧』。吾言已在前矣，吾欲全吾言，安得全吾身！且夫貞臣也難至而節見，忠臣也累至而行明。子則有賜而忠我矣，雖然，吾有語在前者也，終不敢失。」李兌曰：「諾，子勉之矣！吾見子已今年耳。」涕泣而出。李兌數見公子成，以備田不禮之事。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"李兌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002428","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0008","start":8,"end":11,"surface":"公子章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002421","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"田不禮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"二人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0158","start":158,"end":161,"surface":"公子成","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002404","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0183","start":183,"end":185,"surface":"主父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002380","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0186","start":186,"end":187,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0188","start":188,"end":189,"surface":"義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0215","start":215,"end":216,"surface":"義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0226","start":226,"end":228,"surface":"不禮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0344","start":344,"end":346,"surface":"李兌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002428","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0370","start":370,"end":372,"surface":"李兌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002428","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0374","start":374,"end":377,"surface":"公子成","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002404","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m078-0380","start":380,"end":383,"surface":"田不禮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002427","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p079","text":"異日肥義謂信期曰：「公子與田不禮甚可憂也。其於義也聲善而實惡，此爲人也不子不臣。吾聞之也，姦臣在朝，國之殘也；讒臣在中，主之蠹也。此人貪而欲大，内得主而外爲暴。矯令爲慢，以擅一旦之命，不難爲也，禍且逮國。今吾憂之，夜而忘寐，饑而忘食。盜賊出入不可不備。自今以來，若有召王者必見吾面，我將先以身當之，無故而王乃入。」信期曰：「善哉，吾得聞此也！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"肥義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"信期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002429","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"公子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"田不禮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002427","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"義","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002386","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0074","start":74,"end":75,"surface":"主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、代詞、未名君主或版本疑字保留；不把帝王泛稱、父子群體與未決分封當已確證身份或任期。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0152","start":152,"end":153,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m079-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"信期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002429","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p081","text":"主父及王游沙丘，異宮，公子章卽以其徒與田不禮作亂，詐以主父令召王。肥義先入，殺之。髙信卽與王戰。公子成與李兌自國至，乃起四邑之兵入距難，殺公子章及田不禮，滅其黨賊而定王室。公子成爲相，號安平君，李兌爲司寇。公子章之敗，往走主父，主主開之，成、兌因圍主父宮。公子章死，公子成、李兌謀曰：「以章故圍主父，卽解兵，吾屬夷矣。」乃遂圍主父。令宮中人「後出者夷」，宮中人悉出。主父欲出不得，又不得食，探爵鷇而食之，三月餘而餓死沙丘宮。主父定死，乃發喪赴諸侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m081-0000","start":0,"e